OL,3,GNEWSAImprovised play is the
OL,4,Alongest-running outside London
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's the longest-running theatre show
OL,7,Foutside London and the cast have no
OL,8,Fidea what their fellow performers are
OL,9,Fgoing to say as every line is
OL,10,Fimprovised on the spot. Welcome to
OL,11,F'Closer Each Day.'
OL,13,FThe soap opera-themed show is
OL,14,Fcelebrating its 15th birthday with a
OL,15,Fspecial season at the Bristol Old Vic,
OL,16,Fhaving been performed every fortnight
OL,17,Fat the city's Wardrobe Theatre since it
OL,18,Fbegan.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
