OL,3,GNEWSAImprovised play is the
OL,4,Alongest-running outside London
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver hundreds of performances it has
OL,7,Ftouched on many classic soap opera
OL,8,Fplotline from affairs and unrequited
OL,9,Flove to arguments and - at the end of
OL,10,Flast season - many of the cast being
OL,11,Fpushed off a cliff. They survived by
OL,12,Fthe way.
OL,14,F"You have to be open to what's actually
OL,15,Fhappening in that moment, what the
OL,16,Fother person is doing on stage," says
OL,17,FLindsey Garwood who plays devious
OL,18,Fpower-hungry MP Constance Sugar.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
